      "description": "Data repository for solar and meteorological ground measurements from a network of weather stations in West Africa. The data is provided in the framework of the West African Power Pool project: \"Solar Development in Sub-Saharan Africa - Solar resource measurement campaign in West Africa”. Funding is provided by World Bank. Measurement Date Range: - Tambacounda: 2021-11-11 – 2023-11-10 - Ourossogui: 2021-10-29 – 2023-10-28",
